  "properties": {
    "title": "State of MapServer",
    "description": "MapServer is a founding OSGeo project and used for publishing spatial data and interactive mapping applications to the web [1]. This talk provides an overview of enhancements and features in the new 8.2 release of MapServer and its scripting language MapScript, along with upcoming plans for the future.  \r\n\r\n[1] https://mapserver.org/",
